"a\n9) nine"  -> "a\n9) nine\n10) "
"- item"      -> "- item\n- "
"  * nested"  -> "  * nested\n  * "
"- [x] done"  -> "- [x] done\n- [ ] "
"1. one\n2. " -> "1. one\n"        (empty item leaves the list)
"- - -"       -> null              (rule, not list)
"plain text"  -> null
"• bullet"    -> "• bullet\n• "
```
